1
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:12,600
I asked you what you dream of

2
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:16,700
You didn't say a word

3
00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:19,780
Now I walk the way you walked

4
00:00:19,780 --> 00:00:23,800
And hear what you have heard

5
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:27,780
There's a beat inside your hands

6
00:00:27,780 --> 00:00:32,800
You never let me hear

7
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:35,780
Three steps behind you

8
00:00:35,780 --> 00:00:39,800
I'm counting too

9
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:43,000
Every step you took

10
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:47,700
Is leading me to you

11
00:00:47,700 --> 00:00:51,160
The city's waking up now

12
00:00:51,160 --> 00:00:54,220
A thousand hurried feet

13
00:00:54,220 --> 00:00:59,160
But in the noise I only hear

14
00:00:59,160 --> 00:01:02,300
The count you never speak

15
00:01:02,300 --> 00:01:06,060
I don't have the words to say

16
00:01:06,060 --> 00:01:10,200
So I'm bringing flowers instead

17
00:01:10,200 --> 00:01:14,520
Three steps behind you

18
00:01:14,520 --> 00:01:17,980
I'm counting too

19
00:01:17,980 --> 00:01:22,220
Every light you left on

20
00:01:22,220 --> 00:01:26,520
Is leading me to you

21
00:01:26,520 --> 00:01:30,310
Down the hall the monitors

22
00:01:30,310 --> 00:01:34,520
Are keeping someone's time

23
00:01:34,520 --> 00:01:38,100
Every heart in here is counting

24
00:01:38,100 --> 00:01:41,240
Yours, and hers, and mine

25
00:01:41,240 --> 00:01:46,100
One, two, three, and four

26
00:01:46,100 --> 00:01:51,600
Now I know what it's for

27
00:01:53,240 --> 00:01:58,740
If you're counting to four

28
00:01:59,080 --> 00:02:03,400
Let me count with you
